    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1561_1#1$1",
            "duration": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.8
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver",
        "text": "Eirene, here. The schedule table for this year."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver",
        "text": "As you said, I marked all the Venezia Trucking related records. Trip times, loading instructions, driver names... they're all in there."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Yep, matches with Sommer's notebook."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Sommer wanted to bring Guri here; Carmelo was secretly nursing his injuries with alcohol and couldn't get it from us; Gianni and Ruggiero had their own troubles too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Every member of ours they targeted was carefully selected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "There aren't many records, but the shipment frequency is very consistent. That night wasn't the first time they smuggled weapons into the city for sure..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "You were right. That judge did come looking for you at the camp. After she left, some famiglie associates were tailing her in secret."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "So..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "I drove behind her car and came back here only after I saw her enter the courthouse."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Good."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "There's also one more thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "I happened to see Saluzzo Vino's legal team hurrying into the courthouse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "I asked around, and apparently not long ago the police suddenly showed up at one of the Saluzzo wineries and took Alberto away."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "Venezia Trucking also got the cops at their door at the same time. The police and judges should be inspecting their factories right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Lavinia probably doesn't know about the weapons yet, but the car accident and port fire has already sent out a dangerous signal..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Leontuzzo's injured and still hospitalized even now. As Nuova Volsinii's Supreme Justice, she tries her best to get the situation under control."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "She didn't use a direct method with us like she did with the other two... she went to camp to warn us."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "In other words, an ultimatum."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1561_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Truck Driver",
        "text": "Wait, about what Lyudmila just said..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Neither Alberto or Venezia Junior will willingly meet their demise."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Lavinia's in danger right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "Those wise guys only followed her with no intentions to harm her."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "We're in Nuova Volsinii after all, we got cops patrolling the streets. Besides, they have an even better time slot available..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "You mean Carnevale...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "We could let the judge know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eirene stays still for a long time before shaking her head."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "Are you still hesitant to let her know about the Truckers' Union? But can you really just stand here and watch something happen to her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "She's not a bad person at least."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "You got it wrong, Lyudmila."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "It's too late for us now to stay out of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "If the famiglie dare make a direct attempt on Lavinia's life during Carnevale, there's no chance they'll let the Truckers' Union go. If that happens, we can only wait for the slaughter to happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "I'm just thinking what I should do. I don't want something like what happened with Sommer to happen again..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Giving Lavinia a direct warning isn't the best choice here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Lyudmila, did you see the weapons? How many were there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "Based on the amount I saw and total number of shifts on the schedule\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "I estimate there's enough Venezia weapons in the city to arm several tactical squads with dozens of people in each."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "We have more than two hundred registered members, but if we include ad-hoc staff and contract workers, we'll have several times the number of people."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "I just realized the Truckers' Union is actually the largest organization in Nuova Volsinii."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Maybe we can manage it. Protecting a single person in the dark."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "Do you really just want to protect that judge?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "Sommer taught me one thing at least: no one can be trusted in this city but ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1542_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Eirene",
        "text": "So we can only protect ourselves... even if that means resorting to violence."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila",
        "text": "When I was in Ursus, I knew someone with similar ideas. She lost herself in the end."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
